  <HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>客人坐进柔软的座位里。至少两个。</HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.hint>
  <HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>沙发</HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.0.label>
  <HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>可以放东西的地方。</HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.hint>
  <HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>一张矮桌</HH_Venue_DrugLounge.modExtensions.1.requirements.1.label>
